  दक्षिणे कर्ण&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;मूर्धन्यवघ्राणम् -&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include bg-light-yellow&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;4&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_14/04_ashmA_bhavetyeShA.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h2&gt;०४ अश्मा भवेत्येषा ...{Loading}...&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;4&#34; unfilled=&#34;&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_12/01_ashmA_bhava.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h4&gt;०१ अश्मा भव ...{Loading}...&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;अश्मा॑ भव पर॒शुर्भ॑व॒ हिर॑ण्य॒मस्तृ॑तं भव ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;प॒शू॒नान्त्वा॑ हिङ्का॒रेणा॒भि  जि॑घ्राम्य् असौ+++(→नामनिर्देशः)+++।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h5 id=&#34;करण-जप&#34;&gt;कर्णे जपः&lt;/h5&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;उत्तरान्मन्त्रान् +++(=अग्निरायुष्मान् स वनस्पतिभिः)+++ जपेत् १२&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include bg-light-yellow&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;4&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_14/05_agnirAyuShmAn_vanaspatibhiH.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;+++(हे यजमान)+++&lt;br&gt;&#xA;अग्नि᳓र् आ᳓युष्मान् ,&lt;br&gt;&#xA;स᳓ व᳓नस्-प᳓तिभिर् आ᳓युष्मान् ,&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ते᳓न त्वा᳓ ऽऽयुषा᳓ ऽऽयुष्मन्तङ् करोमि ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include bg-light-yellow&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;4&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_14/06_soma_AyuShmAn_oShadhIbhiH.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;सो᳓म आ᳓युष्मान् स᳓ ओ᳓षधीभिर् [आ᳓युष्मान् ते᳓न त्वा᳓ ऽऽयुषा᳓ ऽऽयुष्मन्तङ् करोमि ।]&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include bg-light-yellow&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;4&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_14/07_yajna_AyuShmAn_dakShiNAbhiH.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;+++(हे यजमान)+++ यज्ञ᳓ [आ᳓युष्मान्], स᳓ द᳓क्षिणाभिर् आ᳓युष्मान्, [ते᳓न त्वा᳓ ऽऽयुषा᳓ ऽऽयुष्मन्तङ् करोमि ।]&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include bg-light-yellow&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;4&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_14/08_brahma_AyuShmAn_brAhmaNaiH.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;+++(हे यजमान)+++ ब्र᳓ह्मा᳓युष्मत्, त᳓द्ब्राह्मणै᳓रा᳓युष्मत् , [ते᳓न त्वा᳓ ऽऽयुषा᳓ ऽऽयुष्मन्तङ् करोमि ।]&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include bg-light-yellow&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;4&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_14/09_devA_AyuShmantaH_amRutena.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;+++(हे यजमान)+++ देवा᳓ आ᳓युष्मन्तः।  &#xA;ते᳙ऽमृ᳓तेन [+आ᳓युष्मन्तः]  [ते᳓न त्वा᳓ ऽऽयुषा᳓ ऽऽयुष्मन्तङ् करोमि ।]&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;  &#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;कमरय-अभमनतरणम&#34;&gt;कुमार्या अभिमन्त्रणम्&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;3&#34; unfilled=&#34;&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/sUtra-pAThaH/vishvAsa-prastutiH/14_nAmakaraNam/15_13_kumArImuttareNa.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;कुमारीमुत्तरेण यजुषा +++(&#34;सर्व॑स्मादा॒त्मन॒स्संभू॑ताऽसि॒ सा जी॑व श॒रद॑श्श॒तम् । &#34;)+++ ऽभिमन्त्रयते १३  &#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include bg-light-yellow&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;4&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_yajuH/taitt